{"root":{"data":{"id":"dldte2wisxk0","created":1789264672233,"text":"血液的一般检查"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtf2310f40","created":1789264748813,"text":"血常规检测概况","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtkzw0nzc0","created":1789265214221,"text":"血常规检测标本","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtl4atytc0","created":1789265223824,"text":"采血方法：静脉采血法，毛细血管采血","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtnxhjk4g0","created":1789265444085,"text":"采样体积：2ml/≥200ul","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldto0mg5hs0","created":1789265450912,"text":"紫管抗凝：常用EDTA K2（终浓度为1.5~2.2mg/ml），一般不用枸橼酸钠或肝素","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldto32c9340","created":1789265456226,"text":"样本保存：室温下18℃~25℃，2~3h（不超过24h）","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtlvkn4n40","created":1789265283190,"text":"RBC的检测","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtm23u3ow0","created":1789265297411,"text":"量的检测","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtmbiecxk0","created":1789265317883,"text":"个数——红细胞数量RBC：测定单位体积血液中红细胞的数量（10^{12}/L）","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtnd8v7ns0","created":1789265400024,"text":"方法：：自动血细胞计数仪、显微镜计数法","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtnho9otk0","created":1789265409663,"text":"参考值","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtnl47gt40","created":1789265417157,"text":"成年女性：3.5~5.0x10^{12}/L","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtnot1p480","created":1789265425189,"text":"成年男性：4~5.5x10^{12}/L","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtnru7jj40","created":1789265431790,"text":"新生儿：6.0~7.0x10^{12}/L","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtpedlh7c0","created":1789265559215,"text":"有效分子含量——血红蛋白浓度HGB：血液中各种血红蛋白的综合浓度单位以g/L表示","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtpvhz88o0","created":1789265596486,"text":"  方法：比色法、比重法、血氧法、测铁法，常用氧化高铁血红蛋白测定法","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtq2jtx600","created":1789265611835,"text":"参考值","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtq8pvsp40","created":1789265625262,"text":"成年女性： 110 ～ 150 g /L","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtqdw42xk0","created":1789265636523,"text":"  成年男性： 120 ～ 160 g /L","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtqgt6cug0","created":1789265642875,"text":"     新 生 儿： 170 ～ 200 g /L","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtqp2mfk00","created":1789265660861,"text":"临床意义","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtqu6ardk0","created":1789265671967,"text":"增高\n成人男性 \n RBC > 6.0×10^{12}/L   Hb>170g/L\n成年女性  \nRBC> 5.5×10^{12}/L   Hb>170g/L","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtqyqe3ao0","created":1789265681889,"text":"相对性增高","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtsevfz5c0","created":1789265795387,"text":"血浆中水份丢失，使有形成分相对增多，如呕吐、大面积烧伤","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtsizcsao0","created":1789265804331,"text":"绝对性增高","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtspdv4vc0","created":1789265818269,"text":"生理性：高原人、新生儿","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtt0hgc0w0","created":1789265842430,"text":"大气氧分压低，Epo促红细胞生成素增多（主要是由肾脏的肾小球球旁细胞即肾间质细胞分泌产生的），促进骨髓造血，RBC增多","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldttbc49ko0","created":1789265866052,"text":"婴幼儿与成年人的Hb含量不同","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldttksuj0g0","created":1789265886655,"text":"与之相关的疾病：新生儿黄疸。\n机制：宫内胎盘供氧氧分压低，胎儿被迫造大量红细胞；出生后肺呼吸建立，血氧明显升高，不再需要这么多红细胞，大量胎儿红细胞被机体破坏，释放血红蛋白生成胆红素，引发新生儿生理性黄疸，一般一周后胆红素可以降低，或者是降到正常，如果不降可能是病理性的黄疸","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtuhzklx40","created":1789265958895,"text":"病理性："},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtuuyht9s0","created":1789265987128,"text":"严重的心肺疾患、真性RBC增多症，某些肿瘤（子宫肌瘤、肾肿瘤、肝癌、肾癌均可引发EPO增多）"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtv4th6fc0","created":1789266008593,"text":"降低"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtv86nilc0","created":1789266015920,"text":"生理性"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtvbx8yao0","created":1789266024058,"text":"妊娠妇女:血容量增加、血液稀释"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtvmqemnc0","created":1789266047589,"text":"儿童：6个月~2岁，生长发育快，造血原料不足"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtvpyugrc0","created":1789266054630,"text":"   老年人：造血功能减退"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtvt7ibko0","created":1789266061684,"text":"病理性"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtvvz42hs0","created":1789266067707,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}